{"title":"2013 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/d/5cd255a7b61885fefe56c7e586bf54e21ded5ecf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{99!}{101! - 99!} = \\frac{1}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"123\" height=\"41\" />, determine the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.<br />\n(If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is a positive integer, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/9/cb9d913109f09f79aa0f9b8182f420dd409b69ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m!$\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> represents the product of the integers from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />, inclusive. For example, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/b/e8be7b7587f8965f048752ab9b4a5020fac55095.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5! = 5(4)(3)(2)(1) = 120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"194\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/4/564c48577f96cfcea9ff01bcd1b79ece9ac73d2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99! = 99(98)(97)\\cdots (3)(2)(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"229\" height=\"20\" />.)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/6/106f975c7af22e10a7e28cf8576a3f193a413b6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n + 2)! = (n + 2) \\times (n + 1) \\times n!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"261\" height=\"20\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/d/5cd255a7b61885fefe56c7e586bf54e21ded5ecf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{99!}{101! - 99!} = \\frac{1}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"123\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/9/2e9612a74830dec3894a167f303d579a79d1edd1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{99!}{101 \\times 100 \\times 99! - 99!} = \\frac{1}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"213\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/a/abab8f95fbed08ad37853e139d465fce7f9a3b83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{99!}{99!(101 \\times 100 - 1)} = \\frac{1}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"210\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/6/3a6acf19648db9e9b5122b1ce1e08627838b3b1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{1}{10~100 - 1} = \\frac{1}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"146\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>The numerators are equal to each other, meaning the denominators must be equal to each other as well. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/0/3b01cc3f459bf060adf43ad42345a645dafc2f5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 10~100 - 1 = \\boxed{10~099}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"206\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CSMC\" title=\"2013 CSMC\">2013 CSMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CSMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CSMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CSMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CSMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2013 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Part A Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2013 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2013 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Senior_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Senior Competition\">CEMC Senior Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018055747\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.019 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.026 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 118/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1283/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 134/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2716/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.880      1 Template:CEMC_CIMC/CSMC_box\n100.00%    6.880      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37298:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018055747 and revision id 287957.